{#- The name written letter by letter on the homepage's title panel (site.css,
    "The written letters"): set as SVG words by the `drawn` filter, each letter
    its pen strokes and its outline. The text itself stays in the page beside
    it for readers and search engines. -#}
<span class="wordmark__drawn" aria-hidden="true">{{ (site.fullName + " Laboratory") | drawn(drawnLetters) | safe }}</span>
